Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I hope you're already proud seeing your former SK chair

asr-000039
00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:58.460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: or president leading this hearing.

asr-000040
00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Members of the committee.

asr-000041
00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Officials of the Department of Urban Settlement and Urban

asr-000042
00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:13.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Development, headed by, of course, Secretary Ping Aliling,

asr-000043
00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: and its attached agencies and corporations,

asr-000044
00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:20.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: our resource persons, distinguished guests,

asr-000045
00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:22.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Maayong hapon sa aton tanan.

asr-000046
00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Today's budget briefing gives the committee an opportunity

asr-000047
00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:30.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to assess the department's performance

asr-000048
00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:37.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: under the fiscal year 2026 budget, review the implementation

asr-000049
00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:43.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: of its major programs, and determine whether the proposal

asr-000050
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: or the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget is adequate

asr-000051
00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: and responsive to the country's continuing housing needs.

asr-000052
00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:53.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We recognize the progress achieved under the expanded

asr-000053
00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pabansang-Pabahay para sa Pilipino, or 4PH program,

asr-000054
00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:00.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: particularly the adoption

asr-000055
00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:07.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: of more flexible housing modalities and the mobilization of private sector participation.

asr-000056
00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:15.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Stronger coordination with LGUs and other national government agencies is likewise essential

asr-000057
00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:22.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to translating these initiatives into affordable and sustainable housing options for Filipino

asr-000058
00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: families.

asr-000059
00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:29.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: At the same time, serious challenges remain.

asr-000060
00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:37.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: These include the substantial housing deficit, limited access to suitable land and affordable

asr-000061
00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:45.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: housing or financing, permitting and implementation delays, and the need to ensure the approved

asr-000062
00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:52.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: projects are funded, completed, and turned over to qualified beneficiaries.

asr-000063
00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:58.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: The committee is particularly concerned about the persistent gap between the national housing

asr-000064
00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:03.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: requirements and the department's current delivery targets.

asr-000065
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:11.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: For fiscal year 2027, the proposed budget must provide clear and concrete responses

asr-000066
00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to these challenges.

asr-000067
00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:28.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Under the fiscal year 2027 NEP, DHSUD and its attached agencies and corporations are allocated a combined ₱5.498 billion.

asr-000068
00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:47.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And this ₱579.55 million, or about 9.5%, below ₱6.78 billion provided under the 2026 fiscal year GAA.

asr-000069
00:06:47.280 --> 00:07:05.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And ₱54.52 billion, or ₱5.2 billion lower than the agency's aggregate ₱60 billion budget proposal. Of the net amount, ₱2.492 billion is allocated to DHSUD.

asr-000101
00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:25.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ₱2.274 billion to NHA, ₱566 million to HSAC, ₱1.66 million to SHFC, and ₱450,000 to NHFC.

asr-000102
00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:49.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Given these differences, the Committee will closely examine fiscal year 2026 fund utilization and accomplishment, the implementation status of ongoing 4PH projects, the causes of delays or underspending, and the measures proposed to accelerate housing delivery.

asr-000103
00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:55.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Above all, every peso appropriated for housing must translate

asr-000104
00:07:55.400 --> 00:08:11.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: into measurable results, more completed and occupied units, broader access to affordable housing, and safer and more dignified living conditions for Filipino families.

asr-000105
00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:19.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We look forward once again to focus on constructive discussion with DHSUD and its attached agencies and corporations.

asr-000106
00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:26.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And with this, we now invite the department to proceed with its presentation.

asr-000107
00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Maraming salamat sa ating lahat.

asr-000108
00:08:33.267 --> 00:08:34.921
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Secretary Aliling, you can...

asr-000110
00:08:35.056 --> 00:08:46.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Maraming salamat po, Chairperson Jam Baronda, former President Gloria Macapagal-Arroyo, members of this committee, Chairperson Marie V. Copilar of the Housing Committee.

asr-000111
00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Lahat po nung nandito ngayon, magandang umaga.

asr-000112
00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:57.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nandito po kami ngayon para i-present sa inyo, unang-una ano ba yung mga ating mga na-accomplish itong nakaraan taon

asr-000113
00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.240
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: at ano yung mga

asr-000114
00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kakailanganin po natin sa susunod na taon.

asr-000115
00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pagdating po sa pag-address ng housing need na based po sa PSA

asr-000116
00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:15.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ay 3.7 million, 3.7 million po, hindi po 6.9 million hanggang 2028.

asr-000117
00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:22.560
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Isa po sa mga highlights ng aming presentation ay mag-aapila po kami

asr-000118
00:09:23.015 --> 00:09:28.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na paano po natin paparamihin yung iba nating mga programa sa pabahay.

asr-000119
00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:38.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Dahil po ang 3.7 million na housing needs by 2028, hindi po ibig sabihin yan kailangan natin gumawa ng 3.7 million na bahay.

asr-000120
00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:48.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Dahil ang 3.7 million po na yan na sinasabi ng PSA na magiging housing needs natin by 2028, nakahati po yan sa tatlong kategories.

asr-000121
00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:56.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number one, ito po, meron po mga kasalukuyang may bahay ngayon, ngunit kailangan na ayusin.

asr-000122
00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:01.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So ang kailangan po niyan, hindi po bahay at lupa na bago.

asr-000123
00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang kailangan po niyan, unang-una,

asr-000124
00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:06.820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mapag-andar natin na mas mabilis ang community mortgage program.

asr-000125
00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:10.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: At pag paandar po natin ang community mortgage program,

asr-000126
00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: in-expand po natin yung CMP

asr-000127
00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.440
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: para mapaayos po nila

asr-000128
00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:15.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang kanilang mga tahanan.

asr-000129
00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So yung 1.1 million po na yan,

asr-000130
00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:25.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang solusyon dyan CMP and then yung in-expand po natin ang programa ng SHFC

asr-000131
00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.440
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: pati na po yung pampagawa ng bahay

asr-000132
00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: at utilities nila.

asr-000133
00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:33.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kunyari binabaha, kailangan na mga ayusin yung mga site development, kasama na po dyan.

asr-000134
00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.950
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then, nandyan din po sa solusyon sa number one category na yan

asr-000135
00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ay ang home improvement loan ng Pag-IBIG Fund.

asr-000136
00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:45.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pangalawang kategorya po, ito po ang tinatawag nating mga double up.

asr-000137
00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.340
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ano po ba itong double up?

asr-000138
00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:52.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang double up po, ito po yung may mga bahay na mas marami sa isang pamilya ang nakatira.

asr-000139
00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, ang hinahighlight lang po natin sa pangalawang kategorya na ito,

asr-000140
00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:01.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: hindi po ito nalilimit sa informal settler families.

asr-000141
00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:11.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Lahat po, yung buong spektrum po ng housing, sinasabi ko nga para maintindihan,

asr-000142
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:11.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mula sa ISF areas hanggang sa Forbes Park ang nakatira,

asr-000143
00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:17.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kung more than one family po ang nakatira sa bahay na yun, kasama po dito sa numero na ito.

asr-000144
00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:26.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pangatlo, 1.1 million po ang projected ng PSA na magkakaroon ng sariling pamilya.

asr-000145
00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po,

asr-000146
00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:36.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang kailangan nito kung mag-dedecision silang humiwalay sa kanilang mga present na pamilya, sa kanilang mga magulang,

asr-000147
00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: makangilangan po ito ng bahay.

asr-000148
00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:46.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pangatlo, dito po nagkaroon ng diferensya yung 6.9 million sa 3.7 million na housing needs.

asr-000149
00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Doon po sa 6.9 million, yung unang pong study,

asr-000150
00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:56.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang assumption po doon, yung inventory loss, ito yung may mga bahay ngayon na masisira

asr-000151
00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: through wear and tear, bagyo, earthquake, etc.

asr-000152
00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:05.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nakalagay po doon, 3.7 million ang projected na loss in inventory.

asr-000153
00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:11.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Dito po, sa 3.7 million na housing need na sinasabi ng PSA,

asr-000154
00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:17.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang sinasabi lang dito, kung meron pong masisirang 3.7 million, meron pong magpapagawa.

asr-000155
00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:25.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So pag binawas nyo po yung magpapagawa, ang sinasabi po ng latest na PSA na survey o study,

asr-000156
00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:29.700
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang magiging loss ng inventory lang is P399,000.

asr-000157
00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:40.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So yun lang po ang naging diferensya nung P6.9 million na unang sinasabi nating projected na housing needs by 2028

asr-000158
00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:45.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: versus itong P3.7 million na latest na linabas po ng PSA.

asr-000159
00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:53.920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So ito po, sinasabi lang namin, ang 4PH alone, hindi siya ang solusyon dito sa housing needs na 3.7.

asr-000160
00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:59.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kasi tulad niya po na nasabi ko, kasama po dito yung formal communities.

asr-000161
00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:07.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So pati po yung gagawin ng mga bahay, ng mga private developers,

asr-000162
00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:13.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ito po kasama po ito sa magsasolve ng 3.7 million na housing backlog natin by 2028.

asr-000163
00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:22.760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pagdating naman po sa regulatory, tayo po ay binabalansin natin ang interest ng mga developers at ng mga homebuyers.

asr-000164
00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:30.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So kung ito po mga nakarang araw, maririnig po natin o mababasa natin sa mga social media

asr-000165
00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:36.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na may mga umapila sa amin ang mga developers na nakahihirapan po kumuha ng mga license to sell.

asr-000166
00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:41.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So inayos po natin ito, basically 10 weeks na po

asr-000167
00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:48.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ten weeks na po, consecutive weeks, ang DHS-UD na zero pending overdue sa regulatory applications.

asr-000168
00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:59.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang ibig pong sabihin nito, lahat po ng regulatory applications nitong nakaraang sampung linggo ay naaksyonan within 15 days.

asr-000169
00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: within 15 days, 1-5, 15 days.

asr-000170
00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ano po ba itong mga aksyon na ito?

asr-000171
00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Una-una, pwedeng ma-approve ang kanilang mga application.

asr-000172
00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:13.160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pangalawa, pwedeng ma-deny.

asr-000173
00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:19.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pangatlo po, pwede po silang ma-issuehan ng Notice of Deficiencies.

asr-000174
00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:26.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pag sila po ay na-issuehan ng Notice of Deficiencies, meron po silang 90 days to comply.

asr-000175
00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:30.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon, ang ginawa po natin para madalian po silang mag-comply,

asr-000176
00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: naglabas po tayo ng guidelines na bago na

asr-000177
00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: they are allowed to apply for temporary license to sell

asr-000178
00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.420
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: habang kinukumply po nila ang kanilang mga deficiencies.

asr-000179
00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:46.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So nito pong nakaraang dalawang buwan,

asr-000180
00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:55.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ito pong July and towards the end of June, July and August,

asr-000181
00:14:56.000 --> 00:15:00.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: nakita po natin ang numero po na qualify or na-approve na mga license to sell ay tumaas po.

asr-000182
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: In fact, yung numero po ng ating mga license to sell

asr-000183
00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:11.560
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ating mga license to sell na na-approve or na-qualify for any kind of license to sell.

asr-000184
00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:24.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pwede po siyang regular license to sell, conditional license to sell, or temporary license to sell.

asr-000185
00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:29.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Makikita po natin, on the same period po ng last year, 2025, pareho na po halos ang ating numero ng 2025 and 2026.

asr-000186
00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:35.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pagdating naman po sa mga reklamo ng mga homebuyers,

asr-000187
00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:44.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Gina-action na rin po ng departamento ang mga reklamo nila through mass conciliations. Meron po tayong datos dyan na kung dati po, ang dinatnang po namin backlog no, nung ako yung naging na-appoint na sekretary

asr-000188
00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:46.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang kailangan namin action na rin was 3,000.

asr-000189
00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So na-address na po namin yan.

asr-000190
00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:54.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Although tuloy-tuloy po yung pag-file ng mga reklamo ng mga homebuyers versus the developers

asr-000191
00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:58.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Tuloy-tuloy po ang pagkakondak natin ng mga conciliations.

asr-000192
00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:02.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So ito na po ang DHSUD ngayon.

asr-000193
00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:07.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Sana po ito pong presentation namin, ito pong ina-appel na namin

asr-000194
00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:12.080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na dagdag na pondo para sa mga housing programs po ng gobyerno ay inyong makonsider.

asr-000195
00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Magandang hapon po. Maraming salamat po.

asr-000196
00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:18.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000197
00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:24.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I would just like to request first, ComSec, to read the resource person from DBM.

asr-000198
00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:28.360
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000199
00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:37.580
Committee Secretary: We would like to acknowledge our resource person, our guest from the DBM, headed by Director Benjelette Zuniga.

asr-000200
00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:39.040
Committee Secretary: Thank you, ma'am.

asr-000201
00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:47.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Before we proceed with interpellators, I would like to remind our distinguished colleagues

asr-000202
00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:52.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: that each member is given five minutes for questioning or interpellation,

asr-000203
00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:55.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: excluding the response of the resource persons.

asr-000204
00:16:55.960 --> 00:17:00.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And when you hear the bell sound, it means you only have like 30 seconds

asr-000205
00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to wind up with your questions.

asr-000206
00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:07.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So as part of our long-standing, repeated tradition of the House of Representatives

asr-000207
00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:13.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to accord preferential treatment to the minority of the House

asr-000208
00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:18.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: and followed by the independent and the majority members in an alternating manner.

asr-000209
00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.420
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Can we present?

asr-000210
00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ah, yes, nagpa-present pala.

asr-000211
00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: That was just the introduction.

asr-000212
00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:24.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

asr-000213
00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:29.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I, I thought we need to dispense the presentation.

asr-000214
00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We'll just proceed with the interpellation.

asr-000215
00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Although I mentioned the summary of the presentation.

asr-000216
00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay, I would like to request once again,

asr-000217
00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:40.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Secretary and some other attached agencies to please proceed with your presentations.

asr-000218
00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000219
00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Usec Henry will present.

asr-000220
00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:44.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Thank you.

asr-000220-split-1
00:17:46.497 --> 00:17:49.028
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pero yun na rin yun.

asr-000221
00:17:49.585 --> 00:17:50.820
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Good afternoon, Madam Chair.

asr-000222
00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:57.620
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Former President Gloria Magal-Arroyo, distinguished members of the House Committee on Appropriations.

asr-000223
00:17:57.620 --> 00:17:59.220
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Today, our briefing focuses

asr-000224
00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:04.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: on the Department, its key shelter agencies, and our various programs.

asr-000225
00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:10.540
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: As an outline, we would like to cover a very brief overview of the agency's mandate,

asr-000226
00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:20.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the proposed budget highlights for 2027, our accomplishments for the year 2025 and the targets,

asr-000227
00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:28.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: our performance, our budget utilization rate, as well as an additional request from our key shelter agencies.

asr-000228
00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.940
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: By way of background, our department is quite young.

asr-000229
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:41.160
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: It's seven years old, but it is the primary national government agency or entity responsible for the management of housing,

asr-000230
00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.160
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: human settlements, and urban development.

asr-000231
00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:52.180
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The department is also the sole and main planning and policymaking, regulatory, program coordination,

asr-000232
00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:58.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and performance monitoring entity for all housing, human settlements, and urban development.

asr-000233
00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:02.940
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Our attached agencies can be categorized into three.

asr-000234
00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.200
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: First, for production with the National Housing Authority,

asr-000235
00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:11.140
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: financing with the Social Housing Finance Corporation,

asr-000236
00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the Pag-ibig Fund,

asr-000237
00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.960
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and the National Home Mortgage Finance Corporation,

asr-000238
00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:23.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and our attached adjudication body, the Human Settlements Adjudication Commission, or HSAAC.

asr-000239
00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:30.240
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: To show you the highlights and major thrusts for 2027's proposed budget,

asr-000240
00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:37.280
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: I'd like to show you the comparison of the 2026 GAA, the 2027 NEP,

asr-000241
00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:45.320
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and the variance between the 2027 proposal of the DSUD and the key shelter agencies.

asr-000242
00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:52.860
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: For 2027 NEP, the total of 5.498 billion has been allocated.

asr-000243
00:19:53.580 --> 00:20:00.480
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In comparison, the amount is 579 million smaller than the 2026 GAA.

asr-000244
00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:09.100
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In contrast, however, the total proposed submission of DSUD and its key shelter agencies

asr-000245
00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: totaled approximately 60 billion,

asr-000246
00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:18.800
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: or an eventual shortfall of 54 billion in the total amount being requested.

asr-000247
00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:28.460
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: For DSUD, the amount that is being allocated for next year is 2.492 billion.

asr-000248
00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:33.420
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In contrast, the requested amount of DSUD for its various flagships,

asr-000249
00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:38.860
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: flagships, and regular programs amount to 4.962 billion.

asr-000250
00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:43.540
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: For the Human Settlements Adjudication Commission,

asr-000251
00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:49.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a total amount of 566 million has been requested for 2027

asr-000252
00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:54.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: against a proposed budget of 890 million.

asr-000253
00:20:54.080 --> 00:21:00.020
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The amount are being requested for HSAAC's resolution of cases and complaints

asr-000254
00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:05.160
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: arising from the implementation of laws, rules, and regulations

asr-000255
00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:09.020
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: related to zoning, subdivision and condominium developments,

asr-000256
00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:14.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: intra and inter homeowners association disputes, and appealed cases.

asr-000257
00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:19.140
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Our main production arm, the National Housing Authority,

asr-000258
00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:25.540
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: is being allocated 2.274 billion for 2027 NEP.

asr-000259
00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:32.360
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In contrast, it requested a budget of 44.732 billion.

asr-000260
00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:35.300
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The amount requested is to...

asr-000261
00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:38.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: ...to support resettlement programs for displaced families,

asr-000262
00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:43.940
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: kalami victims, indigenous peoples, including former rebels.

asr-000263
00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:49.360
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The Social Housing Finance Corporation, another financing agency,

asr-000264
00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:55.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: was being allocated the amount of 166 million for the 2027 NEP.

asr-000265
00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:01.460
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In contrast, it has requested a amount of 4.666 billion.

asr-000266
00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:05.240
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: It is the main arm agency in charge...

asr-000267
00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:07.420
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: ...with the Community Mortgage Program.

asr-000268
00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:13.120
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: And in previous years, have also been involved in high-density housing programs

asr-000269
00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:17.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: in providing support to DOTR and DPWH,

asr-000270
00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:21.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: as well as provide Marawi Shelter Program.

asr-000271
00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:31.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The National Home Mortgage Finance Corporation is being allocated 450,000.

asr-000272
00:22:31.640 --> 00:22:33.960
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Tama po yung kanina, 450,000.

asr-000273
00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:36.440
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In contrast, the amount it is requesting is

asr-000274
00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:38.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: P4.750 billion.

asr-000275
00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:45.440
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: And that amount will be used to purchase receivables of various tenors,

asr-000276
00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:51.220
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: as well as to be utilized for the securitization of its asset-backed securities.

asr-000277
00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:58.380
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Our last attached agency is the Home Development Mutual Fund.

asr-000278
00:22:58.380 --> 00:23:01.520
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: They are not asking for any budget,

asr-000279
00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:05.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: but we would like to highlight its contribution to the

asr-000280
00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:08.300
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: value chain of housing.

asr-000281
00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:14.160
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: It basically addresses the housing needs by providing rental housing loan,

asr-000282
00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.300
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: as mentioned by the Secretary,

asr-000283
00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:19.060
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Home Loan Program, GLAD Plus,

asr-000284
00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:25.440
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for acquisition, including the purchase of ROPA or repossessed assets.

asr-000285
00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:33.280
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In addition, since last year, it has brought down its affordable housing financing

asr-000286
00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:36.600
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: by lowering the percentage...

asr-000287
00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: ...or the interest to 3% for socialized housing,

asr-000288
00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:43.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 4.5% for economic housing,

asr-000289
00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:50.580
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and 5.75% for open housing up to a maximum of 10 million pesos.

asr-000290
00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:58.600
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Let us now consider the accomplishments of the housing sector versus the target in 2025.

asr-000291
00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:07.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: As shown in the table, we have outlined the accomplishment during the administration of President Aquino.

asr-000292
00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:12.460
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Just to clarify, ito pong table na ito is just the government housing program.

asr-000293
00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:22.460
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: So we do not expect these numbers, the 1.13, to address the 3.7 million backlog by 2028

asr-000294
00:24:22.460 --> 00:24:28.840
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: because as I said a while ago, kasama po yung private sector production to address the backlog.

asr-000295
00:24:29.120 --> 00:24:29.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Thank you.

asr-000296
00:24:30.380 --> 00:24:31.920
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000297
00:24:32.280 --> 00:24:37.880
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: So we have outlined here the accomplishments during the term of President Aquino,

asr-000298
00:24:38.100 --> 00:24:47.200
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: President Duterte, and the current administration divided into July 2022 to the present, or July 2026,

asr-000299
00:24:47.460 --> 00:24:53.000
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and then the balance from August 2026 to June of 2028.

asr-000300
00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:56.900
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: For the accomplishment for this administration,

asr-000301
00:24:57.340 --> 00:25:05.720
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a total of 588,757 have been accomplished, direct and indirect units or assistance.

asr-000302
00:25:06.640 --> 00:25:07.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: A total of

asr-000303
00:25:08.620 --> 00:25:17.400
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 544,000 is still to be undertaken with a target of 1.133 million by the end of this administration.

asr-000304
00:25:20.060 --> 00:25:22.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: As noted in the presentation of our Secretary,

asr-000305
00:25:23.400 --> 00:25:31.340
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: since his assumption, the 4PH has been expanded to allow more options to the Filipino families.

asr-000306
00:25:31.340 --> 00:25:35.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In contrast to the vertical housing that was previously undertaken,

asr-000307
00:25:36.380 --> 00:25:39.800
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: today home ownership can include horizontal housing,

asr-000308
00:25:40.180 --> 00:25:44.260
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the real and other property acquired or ROPA,

asr-000309
00:25:44.520 --> 00:25:49.040
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the provision of low-interest incentive programs by Pag-IBIG,

asr-000310
00:25:49.180 --> 00:25:54.120
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: as well as the high-density housing of the Social Housing Finance Corporation.

asr-000311
00:25:54.120 --> 00:25:57.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In terms of rental and transitional housing,

asr-000312
00:25:58.160 --> 00:26:01.360
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: new projects are being developed and have been started,

asr-000313
00:26:01.580 --> 00:26:08.920
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and also modular housing for emergency and temporary housing in disaster-stricken areas.

asr-000314
00:26:10.120 --> 00:26:13.040
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: As part of the revitalization program,

asr-000315
00:26:13.460 --> 00:26:19.520
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the community-led housing through the enhanced community mortgage was revived last year,

asr-000316
00:26:20.358 --> 00:26:22.180
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: covering a period of...

asr-000317
00:26:22.687 --> 00:26:28.600
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: to cover the hiatus of three years in the previous term, previous Secretary.

asr-000318
00:26:28.600 --> 00:26:32.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Today, we have also revitalized the presidential proclamation

asr-000319
00:26:33.460 --> 00:26:36.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and non-socialized housing enrolled under expanded 4PH

asr-000320
00:26:36.740 --> 00:26:40.140
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: to add up to additional land and housing

asr-000322
00:26:40.140 --> 00:26:41.240
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: supply mobilization.

asr-000323
00:26:44.540 --> 00:26:48.300
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The 2025 DSUD performance at a glance.

asr-000324
00:26:48.300 --> 00:26:52.880
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Let me now highlight some of the programs that are being undertaken by the Department.

asr-000325
00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:58.180
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: First is the Human Settlements and Urban Development Coordination Program,

asr-000326
00:26:58.600 --> 00:27:03.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: where the DSUD was able to work with different government agencies

asr-000327
00:27:03.660 --> 00:27:09.220
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: in improving or updating the National Resettlement Policy Framework,

asr-000328
00:27:09.470 --> 00:27:12.440
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the incorporation of emergency shelter support,

asr-000330
00:27:13.000 --> 00:27:14.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: to affected families,

asr-000331
00:27:14.460 --> 00:27:18.920
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the cooperation between DSUD and the SWD

asr-000332
00:27:18.920 --> 00:27:23.240
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for those graduating from the 4Ps to access 4PH,

asr-000333
00:27:23.240 --> 00:27:26.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and our partnership with the Department of Education

asr-000334
00:27:26.680 --> 00:27:30.700
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: to handle the housing requirements in resettlement areas.

asr-000335
00:27:31.460 --> 00:27:35.060
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: With the revitalization of the presidential proclamations,

asr-000336
00:27:35.220 --> 00:27:41.040
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a total of 213 families have been awarded the Certificate of Entitlement.

asr-000337
00:27:41.880 --> 00:27:44.360
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: We have also implemented IDSAP,

asr-000338
00:27:44.360 --> 00:27:47.280
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: or the Integrated Disaster Shelter Assistance Program,

asr-000339
00:27:47.280 --> 00:27:48.800
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and in 2025,

asr-000340
00:27:49.140 --> 00:27:55.860
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: we're able to fund or give benefits to about 16,700 partially damaged houses,

asr-000341
00:27:56.240 --> 00:28:00.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 6,550 totally damaged houses,

asr-000342
00:28:00.880 --> 00:28:04.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: at the amount of approximately 365 million.

asr-000343
00:28:05.520 --> 00:28:09.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: To date, all amount has been spent as of middle of the year.

asr-000344
00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:11.100
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In addition,

asr-000345
00:28:12.020 --> 00:28:15.700
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the DSUD also is mobilizing or has mobilized the National Drive

asr-000346
00:28:15.700 --> 00:28:19.700
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: against professional squatters and squatting syndicates,

asr-000347
00:28:19.760 --> 00:28:22.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: with 39 cases being processed,

asr-000348
00:28:22.440 --> 00:28:25.420
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 12 capacity building among the various agencies,

asr-000349
00:28:25.660 --> 00:28:30.380
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and active local end-ups, cases of about 300.

asr-000350
00:28:31.960 --> 00:28:36.520
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: For our Homeowners Association and Community Development Program,

asr-000351
00:28:36.920 --> 00:28:40.180
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the unit is principally in charge of

asr-000352
00:28:40.180 --> 00:28:42.000
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: registering associations,

asr-000353
00:28:42.000 --> 00:28:43.880
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and to date,

asr-000354
00:28:43.880 --> 00:28:50.180
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: we have a total of 2,705 registered neighborhood homeowners association,

asr-000355
00:28:50.180 --> 00:28:55.060
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 23,698 regular homeowners association,

asr-000356
00:28:55.660 --> 00:28:59.400
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 238 federations,

asr-000357
00:28:59.520 --> 00:29:01.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and 35 confederations.

asr-000358
00:29:02.110 --> 00:29:03.040
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In addition,

asr-000359
00:29:03.320 --> 00:29:08.620
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the Bureau was able to deliver 100% or over 100% achievement

asr-000360
00:29:08.620 --> 00:29:10.180
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: in its capacity building,

asr-000361
00:29:10.180 --> 00:29:13.060
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: while issuing various policies

asr-000362
00:29:13.060 --> 00:29:17.600
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: to enhance the protection of homeowners association.

asr-000363
00:29:20.180 --> 00:29:24.720
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In our Housing and Real Estate Development Regulations Commission,

asr-000364
00:29:25.140 --> 00:29:30.520
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a total of 491 licenses to sell was issued last year,

asr-000365
00:29:30.640 --> 00:29:37.860
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: of which 418 covers residential and 73 non-residential.

asr-000366
00:29:37.860 --> 00:29:41.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Last year, towards end of November and early December,

asr-000367
00:29:42.100 --> 00:29:45.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the Department together with the DEB promulgated

asr-000368
00:29:45.760 --> 00:29:49.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Joint Memo Circular Number 2025-001

asr-000369
00:29:49.660 --> 00:29:51.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and its Implementing Rules and Regulations

asr-000370
00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:57.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: to adjust the price ceiling for socialized subdivision and condominium projects.

asr-000371
00:29:57.640 --> 00:30:22.420
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: With the Bureau of Internal Revenue also, a Revenue Circular No. 48-025 was issued by the Bureau to streamline the requirements for the application of Certificate of Tax Exemptions for Socialized Economic Housing pursuant to Republic Act 7279 and Executive Order 226.

asr-000372
00:30:24.820 --> 00:30:44.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Upon the prodding of the President and with the full support of the Secretary and the other agencies, late June, a Joint Memo Circular No. 1-026 was signed by 15 agencies to streamline the permitting system for housing.

asr-000373
00:30:45.340 --> 00:30:54.260
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: As shown, a number of processes and documentary requirements had been removed or will be removed as part of the streamlining process.

asr-000374
00:30:54.260 --> 00:31:00.520
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: And the overall processing time is expected to be reduced as much as 50%.

asr-000375
00:31:02.640 --> 00:31:14.140
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In the aspect of environmental land use and urban planning and development program, a total of 63.5% of our LGUs now have risk-informed plans.

asr-000376
00:31:14.140 --> 00:31:23.840
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: This number excludes the BARM as they are under the Department of Human Settlements and Development, which is outside the purview of our agency.

asr-000377
00:31:23.840 --> 00:31:25.520
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: A total of 153.

asr-000378
00:31:26.680 --> 00:31:50.720
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In 2023, LGUs were also trained and provided plan smart accounts, six pilot sites were identified for AutoCAM projects, and various LGUs have been provided CLUPs and PDP, a comprehensive land use plan and provincial development, physical development plan programs, subsidy studies in local shelter plant and other.

asr-000379
00:31:50.720 --> 00:31:55.900
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: We have also modernized our policies by the issuance of various guidelines.

asr-000380
00:31:55.900 --> 00:32:08.400
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: On planned unit development, resilient urban design development guidelines, transit-oriented development, and open space development programs.

asr-000381
00:32:09.120 --> 00:32:12.100
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Key planning tools and techniques have also been updated.

asr-000382
00:32:13.380 --> 00:32:25.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Two of the major digital initiatives last year of this program includes Plan Smart, which tries to automate the digitalization of risk-informed local plans.

asr-000383
00:32:26.740 --> 00:32:34.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: This is expected to reduce the planning cycle or review to less than one year from the previous two to three years.

asr-000384
00:32:34.760 --> 00:32:53.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In addition, we are now using digital remote sensing as well as geographic information system plus machine learning or AI to prepare our monitoring of compliance of land use and zoning.

asr-000385
00:32:53.960 --> 00:32:56.480
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: This is being undertaken through our AutoCAM project.

asr-000386
00:33:00.180 --> 00:33:07.100
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In highlighting our budget utilization, let me highlight the following summary.

asr-000387
00:33:07.640 --> 00:33:23.460
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The D-SUDE has a total current budget of 1.455 billion and a continuing budget of 1.497 for a total of 2,952 million.

asr-000388
00:33:23.460 --> 00:33:31.540
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Of this number, 1 billion has already been obligated or about a third has been obligated.

asr-000391
00:33:31.740 --> 00:33:41.340
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: While the obligation rate is 35%, the total disbursement rate is at 74%.

asr-000392
00:33:43.980 --> 00:33:54.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Excluding the amount for subsidy, the D-SUDE has actually exceeded the amount targeted for spending for the first half of this year.

asr-000393
00:33:55.200 --> 00:34:00.320
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: So our rough approximate is 100.4%.

asr-000394
00:34:00.320 --> 00:34:10.820
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: This covers all the various programs including the initiatives undertaken by other programs of the department.

asr-000395
00:34:11.860 --> 00:34:27.380
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: When we look at the comparative budget utilization from 2021 to 2025, for us to be to Apple to Apple, we've removed actually the interest subsidy which only came in 23 and 24.

asr-000396
00:34:27.900 --> 00:34:30.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: So we have an average allocation of...

asr-000397
00:34:31.760 --> 00:34:41.480
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Of which 86.82 overall obligation rate and a 95.37 overall disbursement rate.

asr-000398
00:34:43.360 --> 00:35:01.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Before we end, we'd like to mention that the D-SUDE has, under this administration, been able to receive three consecutive period of unmodified opinion from the department or from the commission on audit for the year 2023-2024.

asr-000399
00:35:02.320 --> 00:35:03.540
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and 2025.

asr-000400
00:35:05.240 --> 00:35:13.960
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Before we end, may we request the consideration of our committee to some of the additional budget requests being considered.

asr-000401
00:35:13.960 --> 00:35:31.240
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: The D-SUDE is proposing additional budget of 280 million to cover ISSP, the implementation and rollout of AutoCAM, the support to the Marawi Board based on Republic Act 11696,

asr-000402
00:35:31.240 --> 00:35:32.720
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the creation

asr-000403
00:35:32.720 --> 00:35:37.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: of an anti-illegal real estate practice interagency task force

asr-000404
00:35:37.260 --> 00:35:41.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and the second phase of the network of open green space

asr-000405
00:35:41.780 --> 00:35:43.860
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and public parks projects.

asr-000406
00:35:44.440 --> 00:35:48.260
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In addition, we would like to support the request

asr-000407
00:35:48.260 --> 00:35:50.340
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: of our attached agencies, AITSAC,

asr-000408
00:35:50.640 --> 00:35:55.820
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for 47 million to cover its COS personnel

asr-000409
00:35:55.820 --> 00:35:58.480
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and motor vehicle procurement,

asr-000410
00:35:58.480 --> 00:36:02.460
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the NHA of 1.623 billion

asr-000411
00:36:02.460 --> 00:36:05.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for its comprehensive and integrated housing program

asr-000412
00:36:05.640 --> 00:36:09.160
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: covering danger areas and SC Mandamus,

asr-000413
00:36:09.980 --> 00:36:13.760
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a amount of 2 billion for the Social Housing Finance Corporation

asr-000414
00:36:13.760 --> 00:36:17.120
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for its enhanced community mortgage program,

asr-000415
00:36:17.120 --> 00:36:24.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and a amount of 8.08 billion broken down to 4.75 million

asr-000416
00:36:24.080 --> 00:36:25.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for the receivables purchase

asr-000417
00:36:25.980 --> 00:36:28.040
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and 3.33 billion

asr-000418
00:36:28.040 --> 00:36:33.960
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for the payment of NHMFC's SSS obligation.

asr-000419
00:36:39.160 --> 00:36:44.960
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: In conclusion, what does our 2027 budget entail

asr-000420
00:36:44.960 --> 00:36:46.340
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: or will be able to do?

asr-000421
00:36:47.720 --> 00:36:50.940
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: One, it will be able to accelerate housing delivery

asr-000422
00:36:50.940 --> 00:36:54.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and expand the pathways beyond the previous single modality.

asr-000423
00:36:55.440 --> 00:36:57.360
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Second, it will allow us to mobilize

asr-000424
00:36:57.360 --> 00:37:00.220
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the whole of the housing finance system

asr-000425
00:37:00.400 --> 00:37:03.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: including Pag-IBIG, the Social Housing Finance Corporation,

asr-000426
00:37:04.180 --> 00:37:08.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and NHMFC to multiply the effect of government funding.

asr-000427
00:37:08.980 --> 00:37:12.640
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Three, improve the location and quality of settlements

asr-000428
00:37:12.640 --> 00:37:16.000
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: by scaling up Planado and the risk-informed

asr-000429
00:37:16.000 --> 00:37:17.700
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: comprehensive land use plans

asr-000430
00:37:17.700 --> 00:37:21.800
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: while strengthening regulation and community governance,

asr-000431
00:37:22.100 --> 00:37:24.720
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: thus reducing processing backlogs

asr-000432
00:37:24.720 --> 00:37:28.220
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and improve consumer and homeowners association services.

asr-000433
00:37:28.660 --> 00:37:32.200
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: And finally, the resolution of specific bottlenecks

asr-000434
00:37:32.200 --> 00:37:33.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: responsible for consumer and home owners association services.

asr-000435
00:37:33.660 --> 00:37:34.840
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: We are also responsible for continuing appropriation

asr-000436
00:37:34.840 --> 00:37:38.080
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and closely monitoring our 2027 delivery.

asr-000437
00:37:38.980 --> 00:37:42.500
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: On that note, we appreciate the committee's continued support

asr-000438
00:37:42.500 --> 00:37:46.240
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: in advancing the dignified housing and sustainable communities

asr-000439
00:37:46.240 --> 00:37:49.500
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and we look forward to working closely with the stakeholders

asr-000440
00:37:49.500 --> 00:37:53.980
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: for a safe, resilient, and inclusive housing sector.

asr-000441
00:37:54.220 --> 00:37:55.260
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Thank you very much.

asr-000442
00:37:56.820 --> 00:37:57.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you.

asr-000443
00:37:57.720 --> 00:38:02.360
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I thought all the while Chairperson Miro Quimbo is here.

asr-000444
00:38:02.500 --> 00:38:03.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: He's having his

asr-000445
00:38:03.520 --> 00:38:05.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: meeting with committee on

asr-000446
00:38:05.780 --> 00:38:08.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ways and means. Naghanap ng pondo

asr-000447
00:38:08.020 --> 00:38:09.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: baka may pangdagdag tayo.

asr-000448
00:38:10.460 --> 00:38:11.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I'm moving forward.

asr-000449
00:38:13.900 --> 00:38:15.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: First to interpelate, of course,

asr-000450
00:38:15.800 --> 00:38:16.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: from the minority,

asr-000451
00:38:16.840 --> 00:38:19.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Assistant Minority Leader, Sarah Jane

asr-000452
00:38:19.900 --> 00:38:20.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ilago.

asr-000453
00:38:22.280 --> 00:38:23.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair.

asr-000454
00:38:24.080 --> 00:38:25.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tungkol sa qualifications

asr-000455
00:38:25.100 --> 00:38:27.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pwedeng mag-apply para sa

asr-000456
00:38:27.600 --> 00:38:29.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: expanded 4PH program,

asr-000457
00:38:29.520 --> 00:38:31.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung isa sa mga requirement

asr-000458
00:38:31.820 --> 00:38:33.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natin ay dapat

asr-000459
00:38:33.900 --> 00:38:34.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: niyembro ng pag-ibig

asr-000460
00:38:34.660 --> 00:38:37.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at nagko-contribute

asr-000461
00:38:37.480 --> 00:38:39.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for 12 months.

asr-000462
00:38:39.280 --> 00:38:39.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama ho ba?

asr-000463
00:38:40.780 --> 00:38:41.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-000464
00:38:42.220 --> 00:38:44.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang concern namin dito, Madam Chair,

asr-000465
00:38:45.060 --> 00:38:46.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: marami ho dun sa mga pinaka

asr-000466
00:38:47.920 --> 00:38:49.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nangangailangan nating mga kababayan.

asr-000467
00:38:49.220 --> 00:38:50.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Wala rin namang trabaho.

asr-000468
00:38:50.580 --> 00:38:52.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kahit po yung voluntary payors

asr-000469
00:38:53.560 --> 00:38:55.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na minimum

asr-000470
00:38:55.300 --> 00:38:57.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa 200 pesos per month,

asr-000471
00:38:57.220 --> 00:38:58.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi pa rin po ganun kadali.

asr-000472
00:38:58.780 --> 00:39:01.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na dun sa mga pinaka walang-wala

asr-000473
00:39:01.300 --> 00:39:03.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nating mga kababayan.

asr-000474
00:39:03.640 --> 00:39:05.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho, meron ho bang

asr-000475
00:39:05.420 --> 00:39:08.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga efforts

asr-000476
00:39:08.560 --> 00:39:09.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ngayon para ma-review

asr-000477
00:39:09.480 --> 00:39:11.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: itong qualifications na ito

asr-000478
00:39:11.120 --> 00:39:12.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at matiyak natin na yung mga pinaka

asr-000479
00:39:13.960 --> 00:39:15.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nangangailangan nating mga kababayan

asr-000480
00:39:15.780 --> 00:39:17.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na low income

asr-000481
00:39:17.140 --> 00:39:19.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o kaya minimum wage earners

asr-000482
00:39:19.140 --> 00:39:20.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at walang regular na trabaho

asr-000483
00:39:20.640 --> 00:39:23.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay makaka-avail sa programa na ito.

asr-000484
00:39:24.740 --> 00:39:25.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Salamat po.

asr-000485
00:39:26.598 --> 00:39:27.003
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Can I?

asr-000486
00:39:27.627 --> 00:39:28.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Secretary, may answer?

asr-000487
00:39:28.340 --> 00:39:31.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang isa po ito sa mga rason kaya natin

asr-000488
00:39:31.220 --> 00:39:33.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: in-expand ang pambansang pabahay

asr-000489
00:39:33.120 --> 00:39:35.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: para sa Pilipino Program or 4PH.

asr-000490
00:39:37.140 --> 00:39:40.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yes, tama po yung sinabi ninyo

asr-000491
00:39:40.100 --> 00:39:42.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na para po siya makautang sa pag-ibig,

asr-000492
00:39:43.260 --> 00:39:45.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kailangan member siya ng pag-ibig

asr-000493
00:39:45.180 --> 00:39:47.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: and para ka maging member ng pag-ibig,

asr-000494
00:39:47.120 --> 00:39:48.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: dapat may trabaho ka.

asr-000495
00:39:49.220 --> 00:39:51.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, in-expand po natin yung 4PH

asr-000496
00:39:51.320 --> 00:39:52.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: dito sa mga hindi magka-qualify

asr-000497
00:39:52.900 --> 00:39:55.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sa mga nasabi natin mga requirements.

asr-000498
00:39:55.600 --> 00:39:57.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nandito po papasok yung ibang modalities

asr-000499
00:39:57.840 --> 00:39:58.820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng 4PH.

asr-000500
00:39:59.080 --> 00:40:00.240
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nandito po yung ating sinisigilan

asr-000501
00:40:01.480 --> 00:40:03.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ngayon na rental housing modality

asr-000502
00:40:03.220 --> 00:40:05.440
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: and yung community mortgage program.

asr-000503
00:40:06.330 --> 00:40:09.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yun po ang nakita nating solusyon.

asr-000504
00:40:09.410 --> 00:40:11.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Doon sa mga kababayan natin,

asr-000505
00:40:11.620 --> 00:40:13.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: parang transition lang po ito, no?

asr-000506
00:40:13.200 --> 00:40:15.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Habang hindi pa po sila ready bumili

asr-000507
00:40:15.360 --> 00:40:18.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng kanilang mga tahanan o bahay,

asr-000508
00:40:18.580 --> 00:40:20.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mayroon pong ibang programa ang gobyerno.

asr-000509
00:40:20.580 --> 00:40:22.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa nabanggit nyo po na ibang mga programa,

asr-000510
00:40:22.900 --> 00:40:24.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkano ho kada buwan

