asr-000649
00:46:28.060 --> 00:46:28.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kalahati po nun.

asr-000650
00:46:29.400 --> 00:46:30.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasa kalahati?

asr-000651
00:46:30.312 --> 00:46:30.680
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Opo.

asr-000652
00:46:30.680 --> 00:46:42.040
