DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Madam Chair, ito pong more or less 100,000, ito po yung inventory. Tapos na po ito.

asr-000657
00:47:11.340 --> 00:47:16.940
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yung 30,000 po na binigit ninyo, yun yung actual take-out. Ibig sabihin yun yung nag-loan, na-approve yung loan.

asr-000658
00:47:18.120 --> 00:47:18.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, ano yung pangalawa, ma'am?

asr-000659
00:47:19.260 --> 00:47:22.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ma'am, ano po yung pangalawang tanong?

asr-000660
00:47:24.760 --> 00:47:32.340
