DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Noong 2025 po, ang taken-out units was only 1,000. Actually, yun yung 4PH na numbers noong 2025 before we expanded the program.

asr-000662
00:47:45.440 --> 00:47:51.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon po, nasa almost 130,000 yung inventory ng 4PH.

asr-000663
00:47:52.160 --> 00:48:01.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po yung modality na binibili. Ito po yung vertical, mga condominium, and horizontal, yung mga house and lot na kasama po sa 4PH.

asr-000664
00:48:02.000 --> 00:48:10.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, makikita po natin, more than 120 times po ang in-increase ng production in terms of inventory ng 4PH.

asr-000665
00:48:11.040 --> 00:48:13.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon, paano po ito mapapabilis?

asr-000666
00:48:13.620 --> 00:48:20.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: In-address po natin, tulad po ng sabi ko, ang ka-partner po natin dito sa Pambansang Pabahay para sa Pilipino Program

asr-000667
00:48:20.060 --> 00:48:21.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: are the private sector developers.

asr-000668
00:48:21.860 --> 00:48:27.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: who are developing socialized housing projects sa country.

asr-000669
00:48:28.160 --> 00:48:35.820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, noong binuksan po natin yung 3%, na-address po natin dyan, yung 3% interest program po, 4PH interest program po yan,

asr-000670
00:48:35.840 --> 00:48:43.080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: subsidized interest po yan kasi 6.25 naging 3 ng pag-ibig fund, na-address po natin yung tinatawag natin demand side.

asr-000671
00:48:43.820 --> 00:48:50.940
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, mas marami na pong mga developers ngayon na nag-de-develop na po ng socialized housing.

asr-000672
00:48:51.580 --> 00:48:56.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kasi, napakaganda po, nakita po nila, napakaganda po nung market na ito.

asr-000673
00:48:56.620 --> 00:49:01.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang maganda po kasi sa socialized housing market, hindi ito yung mga bumibili para mag-invest.

asr-000674
00:49:01.720 --> 00:49:04.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito yung bumibili dahil kailangan nila yung mga bahay nila.

asr-000675
00:49:04.740 --> 00:49:11.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, dahil meron po tayong housing needs all over the country, basta nagtayo po tayo ng tamang produkto,

asr-000676
00:49:12.220 --> 00:49:18.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ibig sabihin po natin tamang produkto, tamang lokasyon, nandyan po yung transportation, nandyan yung mga support facilities,

asr-000677
00:49:18.700 --> 00:49:21.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mabilis po nabibenta yung mga socialized housing.

asr-000678
00:49:21.700 --> 00:49:31.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, in the next, ito pong taon na to, marami na po ang ongoing na construction ng socialized housing all over the country.

asr-000679
00:49:31.100 --> 00:49:36.340
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Marami na pong mga developers ang nag-inquire sa atin kung paano natin sila matutulungan.

asr-000680
00:49:36.500 --> 00:49:41.820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang isa pong tulong dito, pag pumunta po sila sa pag-ibig fund, napibigay po sa kanyala,

asr-000681
00:49:41.820 --> 00:49:45.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: saan yung areas na may mga member na nagahanap po ng mga bahay.

asr-000682
00:49:45.500 --> 00:49:50.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, dun sila ngayon nagagawa, market driven na po ang 4PH ngayon.

asr-000683
00:49:50.240 --> 00:49:54.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kaya sigurado, pag nagtayo sila, meron pong ito magiging takers.

asr-000684
00:49:54.740 --> 00:50:06.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, ang tingin po natin dito, ang tingin po natin dito, yung programa po ng 4PH na sa tamang direction na po,

asr-000685
00:50:06.040 --> 00:50:08.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kailangan lang pabilisin, kailangan dagdagan ng pondo,

asr-000686
00:50:08.840 --> 00:50:15.300
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mas maraming dapat developers magtiwala sa programa para pumasok po dito sa 4PH program natin na ito.

asr-000687
00:50:16.380 --> 00:50:22.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, may sagot na po ba ang DHSUD dito sa COA audit report?

asr-000688
00:50:22.300 --> 00:50:31.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng 2025 tungkol sa payments for interest and non-interest subsidy na umabot sa 66.7 million pesos

asr-000689
00:50:31.100 --> 00:50:35.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na sinasabi po ng COA na walang independent validation at supporting documents.

asr-000690
00:50:37.540 --> 00:50:38.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasagot na po ba natin ang issue dito?

asr-000691
00:50:38.880 --> 00:50:41.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Madam Chair, nasagot na po yan and close na po yung case na yan.

asr-000692
00:50:42.920 --> 00:50:44.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright, maraming salamat po.

asr-000693
00:50:44.900 --> 00:50:49.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating naman dito sa delays sa pagbibigay ng emergency shelter support

asr-000694
00:50:49.860 --> 00:50:53.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ilalim ng Integrated Disaster Shelter Assistance Program,

asr-000695
00:50:54.160 --> 00:51:00.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natugunan na po ba natin yung mga issue sa delays para matiyak na mabilis din nating natutulungan yung ating mga kababayan?

asr-000696
00:51:02.560 --> 00:51:10.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: For our DSUD-IDSA program that has been addressed, there were issuances already on simplification of process.

asr-000697
00:51:10.360 --> 00:51:15.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: However, hanggang last year lang po kami nabigyan ng pondo, this year hindi na po kami nabigyan ng pondo,

asr-000698
00:51:15.940 --> 00:51:17.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: and the new funds are now with NHEA.

asr-000699
00:51:19.200 --> 00:51:23.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano ho ang funds na yun for 2026 and the proposal?

asr-000700
00:51:23.660 --> 00:51:24.660
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Just for 2027.

asr-000701
00:51:25.980 --> 00:51:33.080
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Madam Chair, for the AIDSAP po, it's with NHEA but unfortunately for both AIDSAP po and EHOP,

asr-000702
00:51:33.680 --> 00:51:39.140
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: we haven't still received the SARO from the DBM. We're still waiting pa po for the SARO.

asr-000703
00:51:40.260 --> 00:51:44.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano hong challenge dito pagdating sa, bakit wala pa hong binibigay?

asr-000704
00:51:44.640 --> 00:51:51.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi diba dito rin natin kinukuha halimbawa yung mga kababayan natin na nasunugan na nangangailangan ng dagdag assistance

asr-000705
00:51:51.820 --> 00:51:52.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o biktima

asr-000706
00:51:52.660 --> 00:51:55.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng calamities o ng pagbaha.

asr-000707
00:51:56.300 --> 00:51:56.400
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Tama po.

asr-000708
00:51:56.400 --> 00:51:59.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito ho yung pinagkukunan natin ng dagdag pantulong sa kanila.

asr-000709
00:51:59.720 --> 00:52:06.460
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Tama po yan. We're constantly following up with DBM but unfortunately I cannot speak in behalf of DBM.

asr-000710
00:52:06.720 --> 00:52:12.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, do we have a representative from DBM here who can explain to this committee?

asr-000711
00:52:13.780 --> 00:52:21.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: May we request Director Suniga to please answer?

asr-000712
00:52:33.420 --> 00:52:43.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, in the interest of time, I'd just like to request for a written explanation from DBM on this issue.

asr-000713
00:52:43.620 --> 00:52:49.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay, Mr. DBM, you are requested to please submit your written explanation.

asr-000714
00:52:53.240 --> 00:52:58.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At tungkol dyan, Madam Chair, nais ko rin pong humingi ng paliwanag.

asr-000715
00:52:58.440 --> 00:53:06.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa, sa mga kaso ng mga sunog sa urban poor communities, meron kayong mga nagiging tulungan sa local government units,

asr-000716
00:53:06.280 --> 00:53:08.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matulungan yung mga affected.

asr-000717
00:53:08.960 --> 00:53:14.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po dito sa Quezon City, meron kayong active na tulungan with the Quezon City Local Government Unit.

asr-000718
00:53:14.600 --> 00:53:22.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung sa Manila po ba, meron din po kasi nagsunod-sunod din po yung matitinding sunog at pagkasira ng mga kabahayan,

asr-000719
00:53:23.140 --> 00:53:25.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa Parola Compound.

asr-000720
00:53:25.800 --> 00:53:34.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron din po ba kayong active na pakipagtulungan sa LGU o may plano rin po ba para sa isang on-site or in-city relocation

asr-000721
00:53:34.940 --> 00:53:37.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa mga residente na affected?

asr-000722
00:53:39.540 --> 00:53:44.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In general po, basta meron pong pangangailangan ng isang community o isang LGU.

asr-000723
00:53:44.600 --> 00:53:48.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang naitutulong po ng DSUD sa ka-attached agency are the following.

asr-000724
00:53:48.840 --> 00:53:52.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Number one, nagpapadala po kami ng mga construction materials.

asr-000725
00:53:52.180 --> 00:53:58.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Number two, meron po tayong katulad daw na nabanggit niya ng IDSAP na nasa NHA na ngayon.

asr-000726
00:53:58.280 --> 00:53:59.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Unfortunately, hindi lang funded.

asr-000727
00:54:00.320 --> 00:54:03.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Then pangatlo, meron na po tayong transitory materials.

asr-000728
00:54:03.160 --> 00:54:09.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So transitory housing, temporary housing, naglalagay po tayo ng mga modular shelter units

asr-000729
00:54:10.570 --> 00:54:15.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: basta meron pong lupa na ipoprovide yung LGU.

asr-000730
00:54:15.420 --> 00:54:22.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So yun po yung tatlong tulong na pinaprovide natin sa mga communities na nabanggit po ninyo.

asr-000731
00:54:24.440 --> 00:54:33.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po. Hingi na lang din po tayo ng status report tungkol dito sa mga nangangailangan din ng tulong pagdating sa relocation.

asr-000732
00:54:33.480 --> 00:54:41.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang panawagan nila Madam Chair talagang on-site or in-city para malapit din sa lugar ng trabaho at paaralan ng kanilang mga anak.

asr-000733
00:54:41.400 --> 00:54:52.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Panghuling katanungan ko na lang, dito sa target na 1.13 million housing units sa ilalim po ng Marcos administration, nasaan na po tayo sa pag-abot nito?

asr-000734
00:54:52.380 --> 00:54:56.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: More than 50% na po tayo as reported by the President during the last SONA.

asr-000735
00:54:57.420 --> 00:55:03.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And we are confident that we will be able to meet the 1.13 million commitment.

asr-000736
00:55:04.160 --> 00:55:07.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: By the end term of the current administration.

asr-000737
00:55:08.380 --> 00:55:18.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And I just want to again reiterate that this 1.13 million is not expected to solve the 3.7 backlog.

asr-000738
00:55:19.960 --> 00:55:27.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: There are other private developers who will also do their own production to cover the housing backlog.

asr-000739
00:55:27.740 --> 00:55:30.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So what about the production by the NHA po?

asr-000740
00:55:30.500 --> 00:55:32.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita ko kasi isa din sila sa may pinakamalaking budget.

asr-000741
00:55:32.880 --> 00:55:35.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May pinakamalaking budget cut for the next year.

asr-000742
00:55:36.200 --> 00:55:40.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sa akin lang ho, sana hindi lang po tayo nakaasa sa mga private developers.

asr-000743
00:55:40.820 --> 00:55:49.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero yung sarili din natin na capacity para magtayo ng mga housing units para sa mga nangailangan ay nasusuportahan natin.

asr-000744
00:55:50.300 --> 00:55:54.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In line with that Madam Chair, since wala na po akong oras,

asr-000745
00:55:54.080 --> 00:56:01.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hingin ko na lang po yung masasabi dito ng NHA since natanggalan po sila ng malaking chunk ng pondo.

asr-000746
00:56:01.120 --> 00:56:05.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hingin ko na rin ho yung listahan ng mga private developers.

asr-000747
00:56:05.540 --> 00:56:09.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung lahat ba yan performing, lahat ba yan nagde-deliver.

asr-000748
00:56:10.100 --> 00:56:11.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron ba tayong mga napanagot?

asr-000749
00:56:11.780 --> 00:56:17.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa kung merong under performance sa paggawa ho ng mga housing units.

asr-000750
00:56:18.360 --> 00:56:22.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ay hingin natin mula sa DSUD para maisubmit na sa committee na ito.

asr-000751
00:56:22.820 --> 00:56:24.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Chair.

asr-000752
00:56:25.580 --> 00:56:27.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much, Congresswoman Ilag.

asr-000753
00:56:27.420 --> 00:56:29.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Before that, I would like to request,

asr-000754
00:56:29.940 --> 00:56:35.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: andito na si DBM to please answer bakit hanggang ngayon wala pa rin ang SARO for IDSAP and the IHAP?

asr-000755
00:56:35.940 --> 00:56:42.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Because I believe last year binagdagan niyo na yung pondo from 30,000 to 20,000, right?

asr-000756
00:56:42.680 --> 00:56:45.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Then yung isa naman from 20 to 30.

asr-000757
00:56:45.680 --> 00:56:47.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: DBM, can you please answer?

asr-000758
00:56:48.220 --> 00:56:49.400
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Actually Madam Chair, may I correct myself?

asr-000759
00:56:49.960 --> 00:56:52.380
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Yung IHAP po, there is SARO, wala pong cash.

asr-000760
00:56:53.260 --> 00:56:55.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So may SARO, walang cash.

asr-000761
00:56:55.880 --> 00:56:58.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So may SARO, walang cash. Sabi ni DBM daw.

asr-000762
00:56:59.780 --> 00:57:02.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Assistant Director Lulu Vizpo.

asr-000763
00:57:04.680 --> 00:57:06.620
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yes, good afternoon Madam Chair.

asr-000764
00:57:07.100 --> 00:57:10.600
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yung request po tungkol sa NCA, wala po po silang request.

asr-000765
00:57:10.980 --> 00:57:20.040
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And then when it comes to IHAP, relative to IHAP po, this was requested last April.

asr-000766
00:57:20.040 --> 00:57:24.920
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And then we submit, since this is a congressional insertion,

asr-000767
00:57:25.020 --> 00:57:27.580
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: this was submitted to the Office of the President.

asr-000768
00:57:27.940 --> 00:57:31.160
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: So up to now, wala pa po sa aming binabalik.

asr-000769
00:57:31.160 --> 00:57:41.040
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: But then, it was decided by our Secretary, nagkaroon ng policy na pwede na namin i-process yung mga 2026 po na congressional insertion.

asr-000770
00:57:41.040 --> 00:57:43.640
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: So right now po, ongoing po yung process.

asr-000771
00:57:43.740 --> 00:57:48.220
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: So baka within this week po, ilabas po namin yung request po na yun.

asr-000772
00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:53.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May I just comment briefly, Madam Chair, on that response?

asr-000773
00:57:54.180 --> 00:57:57.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sa akin lang ho, pagdating dito sa emergency shelter support,

asr-000774
00:57:57.380 --> 00:57:59.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dapat hindi tayo nakasalalay sa congressional insertion.

asr-000775
00:58:00.260 --> 00:58:08.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat meron talagang sustenido na pondo para sa shelter support para sa mga nangangailangan natin ng mga kababayan.

asr-000776
00:58:08.660 --> 00:58:11.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalong na sa panahon ngayon na grabe ho ang pagbaha.

asr-000777
00:58:11.260 --> 00:58:13.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sunod-sunod yung sunog sa mga communities.

asr-000778
00:58:13.780 --> 00:58:16.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakaraming walang maayos na tahanan.

asr-000779
00:58:16.900 --> 00:58:22.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At pag ganyan ang sitwasyon, Madam Chair, tumataas din ho yung kaso ng mga gender-based violence.

asr-000780
00:58:22.420 --> 00:58:26.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho, isang bagay ho na dapat unahin natin ang pagtitiyak

asr-000781
00:58:27.140 --> 00:58:30.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nang karapatan sa panirahan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000782
00:58:31.040 --> 00:58:36.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And I just like to reiterate, Madam Chair, my request for the list of banks and private developers.

asr-000783
00:58:36.380 --> 00:58:39.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung magkano po yung tubo sa banko at interest subsidies.

asr-000784
00:58:40.200 --> 00:58:42.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kailangan po natin in preparation for the plenary deliberation.

asr-000785
00:58:42.700 --> 00:58:46.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much, Congresswoman Ilago.

asr-000786
00:58:46.460 --> 00:58:54.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Again, we would like to reiterate to NHA, can you please submit the banks and at the same time the developers.

asr-000787
00:58:54.440 --> 00:59:00.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: The list of developers or are they performing or not.

asr-000788
00:59:05.040 --> 00:59:06.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Contractors, developers.

asr-000789
00:59:07.600 --> 00:59:12.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: The next interpilate is Representative Victoria Copilar, our Chairperson, Committee on Housing.

asr-000790
00:59:13.740 --> 00:59:15.680
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000791
00:59:15.920 --> 00:59:28.160
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: First and foremost, before I propound any clarificatory questions, I would like to recognize and acknowledge the effort and dedication given by DSHUD.

asr-000792
00:59:28.160 --> 00:59:37.440
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Despite since last Congress or 2026, their budget is not that big.

asr-000793
00:59:37.740 --> 00:59:43.940
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Well, in fact, if not for S.Crew, baka walang ginamit na pondo ang DSHUD and other attached agencies.

asr-000794
00:59:44.420 --> 00:59:48.560
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: So, thank you very much, Secretary Ping Aliling and with the rest of your staff.

asr-000795
00:59:48.780 --> 00:59:52.460
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: And with the rest of the USEC for your dedication and commitment.

asr-000796
00:59:52.460 --> 00:59:56.700
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Because I could just see sa postings ninyo.

asr-000797
00:59:56.700 --> 00:59:57.460
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Yung

asr-000798
00:59:57.460 --> 00:59:58.140
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: yung efficiency

asr-000799
00:59:58.140 --> 01:00:00.360
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: ng other attached agencies.

asr-000800
01:00:00.420 --> 01:00:01.000
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Particularly,

asr-000801
01:00:02.300 --> 01:00:02.640
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: waka sabihin nyo,

asr-000802
01:00:02.640 --> 01:00:03.640
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: may paborito naman ako,

asr-000803
01:00:03.760 --> 01:00:05.480
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: pero nakikita ko lagi

asr-000804
01:00:05.480 --> 01:00:05.860
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: yung sa SHFC

asr-000805
01:00:05.860 --> 01:00:06.680
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Sa SHAP-C,

asr-000806
01:00:06.780 --> 01:00:09.980
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: na talagang pati

asr-000807
01:00:09.980 --> 01:00:11.420
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: yung mga presidential proclamations

asr-000808
01:00:11.420 --> 01:00:13.340
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: ay talagang inaasikaso na rin.

asr-000809
01:00:13.660 --> 01:00:14.220
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: However,

asr-000810
01:00:14.540 --> 01:00:15.880
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: dito na ako sa question ko.

asr-000811
01:00:15.960 --> 01:00:16.960
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Andito ba yung DBM?

asr-000812
01:00:19.140 --> 01:00:20.420
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Nawala si assistant.

asr-000813
01:00:20.440 --> 01:00:21.060
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Si DBM.

asr-000814
01:00:27.280 --> 01:00:29.180
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: We would like to request

asr-000815
01:00:29.180 --> 01:00:30.220
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: Assistant Bispo

asr-000816
01:00:30.220 --> 01:00:31.280
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: to please come over

asr-000817
01:00:31.280 --> 01:00:32.800
