asr-001194
01:13:42.640 --> 01:13:45.390
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And we would like to request that they provide

asr-001195
01:13:45.390 --> 01:13:49.160
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: a status update of all these projects.

asr-001196
01:13:49.160 --> 01:13:51.640
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Including the following information for each area.

asr-001197
01:13:51.640 --> 01:13:56.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Number one, the estimated timeline for completion.

asr-001198
01:13:56.080 --> 01:13:58.640
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Number two, whether or not the area is covered

asr-001199
01:13:58.640 --> 01:14:02.660
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: by the 2027 budget in the NEP of DSUD

asr-001200
01:14:02.660 --> 01:14:04.710
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and its key shelter agencies.

asr-001201
01:14:04.710 --> 01:14:08.930
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: If the area is not covered by the 2027 proposed budget

asr-001202
01:14:08.930 --> 01:14:12.760
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: in the NET, bakit ho hindi nila sinama?

asr-001203
01:14:12.760 --> 01:14:16.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ano ho bang mga problema o concerns ang mga

asr-001204
01:14:16.560 --> 01:14:17.350
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ah,

asr-001205
01:14:18.160 --> 01:14:19.770
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: kaakibat nito?

asr-001206
01:14:19.770 --> 01:14:22.600
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At bakit hindi pa nila pinupondohan

asr-001207
01:14:22.600 --> 01:14:25.720
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: in spite of the long delays?

asr-001208
01:14:25.720 --> 01:14:29.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: May I also talk about the Manggahan Residences

asr-001209
01:14:29.560 --> 01:14:31.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: floodway in Pasig?

asr-001210
01:14:31.120 --> 01:14:34.600
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: It has 12 buildings, I understand.

asr-001211
01:14:34.600 --> 01:14:37.420
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Only 10 of which had been occupied.

asr-001212
01:14:37.420 --> 01:14:41.380
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Since the community moved in, they have raised several concerns

asr-001213
01:14:41.380 --> 01:14:44.010
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: on the substandard quality of the buildings

asr-001214
01:14:44.010 --> 01:14:48.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: which many repairs, with many repairs, necessary.

asr-001215
01:14:48.080 --> 01:14:52.950
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Does the NHA have funds allotted for the estate management

asr-001216
01:14:52.950 --> 01:14:56.030
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: of vertical housing projects in general?

asr-001217
01:14:56.030 --> 01:14:57.680
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And if yes,

asr-001218
01:14:57.700 --> 01:15:02.630
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: How can the homeowner associations access these funds?

asr-001219
01:15:03.150 --> 01:15:04.510
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Pwede ba sabihin sa amin yun?

asr-001220
01:15:06.020 --> 01:15:09.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang daming with, there's like three questions, right?

asr-001221
01:15:09.370 --> 01:15:13.930
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: First, we need to answer, Secretary, what's the status of the Presidential Proclamation?

asr-001222
01:15:15.140 --> 01:15:18.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Madam Chair, we will submit the status of each item in the list.

asr-001223
01:15:19.340 --> 01:15:20.080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: If we can be provided.

asr-001224
01:15:20.080 --> 01:15:22.800
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: We will provide you now with the list, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001225
01:15:22.800 --> 01:15:30.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But I would just like to inform everyone, even if may list tayo, bakit ang dami at saka hindi na ayos?

asr-001226
01:15:30.700 --> 01:15:37.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Dahil sa pagpakaalam ko when I went and visited sa Iloilo, we have nine plus three proclamations.

asr-001227
01:15:37.890 --> 01:15:44.910
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang problema, hindi ito maka-move on dahil kailangan i-resurvey ang mga areas.

asr-001228
01:15:45.250 --> 01:15:49.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Because some other proclamations, the Presidential Proclamation, matagal na.

asr-001229
01:15:49.420 --> 01:15:54.770
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So sa masela, ang problema, hindi na makaproceed sa payment, how much amount.

asr-001230
01:15:54.900 --> 01:15:58.170
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Dahil una, kailangan talaga natin i-resurvey.

asr-001231
01:15:58.490 --> 01:16:05.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So we need not only the list of proclamations, but this department needs budget for the survey.

asr-001232
01:16:05.390 --> 01:16:14.210
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang tanong ko, Secretary, do you have budget for the resurveying of this area na under Presidential Proclamation?

asr-001233
01:16:14.860 --> 01:16:23.510
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Unang-una po, ito pong Presidential Proclamation, nahinto po itong pag-processor nito ng unang tatlong taon.

asr-001234
01:16:23.510 --> 01:16:25.370
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So ang sinimal nila lang ulat.

asr-001235
01:16:25.870 --> 01:16:28.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: May proseso noong June 2025.

asr-001236
01:16:29.480 --> 01:16:33.790
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yung po ang unang dahilan, kaya hindi po masyadong umusad ng Presidential Proclamation.

asr-001237
01:16:34.200 --> 01:16:40.070
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Suspended po ito ng tatlong taon na noong in-expand po natin yung 4PH, re-revive natin,

asr-001238
01:16:40.580 --> 01:16:44.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ginawa natin isang modality ng 4PH, yung Presidential Proclamation.

asr-001239
01:16:45.420 --> 01:16:46.700
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: With regards to the budget,

asr-001240
01:16:46.700 --> 01:16:48.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Anong sabi sa?

asr-001241
01:16:48.480 --> 01:16:49.050
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Humingi ba tayo?

asr-001242
01:16:50.670 --> 01:16:51.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Hindi, humingi ba tayo?

asr-001243
01:16:53.300 --> 01:16:53.950
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nabigyan tayo?

asr-001244
01:16:57.580 --> 01:16:58.450
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Magkano hiningi natin?

asr-001245
01:17:00.660 --> 01:17:01.110
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Meron meron.

asr-001246
01:17:01.350 --> 01:17:01.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Meron.

asr-001247
01:17:01.840 --> 01:17:07.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: With regards to budget, meron daw 3 million ngayon for the service.

asr-001248
01:17:08.300 --> 01:17:16.580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Diyos ko, ang budget for...

asr-001249
01:17:16.580 --> 01:17:21.340
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: What kind of a budget is that for such a project?

asr-001250
01:17:21.780 --> 01:17:30.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: These are only, we asked for 151 million, then we were given through the NEP 3 million.

asr-001251
01:17:31.380 --> 01:17:37.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang hiningan lang po namin, iba-iba po kasi ang administrators ng Presidential Proclamation.

asr-001252
01:17:37.120 --> 01:17:41.350
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So yung under sa DHSUD po, yun po yung hininga namin ng budget.

asr-001253
01:17:41.800 --> 01:17:46.170
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yung iba pong Presidential Proclamation, may iba pong ahensya na nag-administer po yan.

asr-001254
01:17:46.780 --> 01:17:54.880
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Can you tell us bakit ganon may mga iba-ibang ahensya ang nagmamanage ng mga Presidential Proclamation?

asr-001255
01:17:55.120 --> 01:17:59.440
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Can it not be just one or interagency?

asr-001256
01:17:59.800 --> 01:18:03.390
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: It all depends po how the proclamation was issued.

asr-001257
01:18:03.390 --> 01:18:06.440
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: So there are those issued by...

asr-001258
01:18:06.890 --> 01:18:09.990
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: By DHSUD or before HADC.

asr-001259
01:18:10.580 --> 01:18:15.060
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Meron din po NHA, meron DND, DSWD, may SPDA, may DNR, DOTR.

asr-001260
01:18:15.280 --> 01:18:15.650
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Iba-iba po yun.

asr-001261
01:18:15.700 --> 01:18:22.940
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Depende po sa pagsulat, pag-issue po ng proclamation.

asr-001262
01:18:25.040 --> 01:18:34.420
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Not proposed now that there should be some sort of an integrated process, interagency tasking.

asr-001263
01:18:35.446 --> 01:18:36.475
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: Madam Chair...

asr-001264
01:18:36.475 --> 01:18:38.180
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Puwede ho bang baguhin yun?

asr-001265
01:18:38.230 --> 01:18:43.720
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: Madam Chair, currently we are working with the Office of the Executive Secretary and the Office of the Cabinet Secretary.

asr-001266
01:18:44.300 --> 01:18:45.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And precisely for that?

asr-001267
01:18:45.740 --> 01:18:46.360
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: Yes, ma'am.

asr-001268
01:18:46.380 --> 01:18:47.820
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: You have actually proposed that?

asr-001269
01:18:48.020 --> 01:18:48.580
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-001270
01:18:48.720 --> 01:18:50.440
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So wala pang status yung request?

asr-001271
01:18:50.640 --> 01:18:55.420
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: So ngayon po, nagpapadala na po ng representative yung mga sa Office ng Executive Secretary, pati rin po sa Cabinet Secretary.

asr-001272
01:18:55.620 --> 01:18:57.160
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: Para po ma-finalize lang po.

asr-001273
01:18:57.300 --> 01:19:02.320
DHSUD Undersecretary Eduardo P. Robles Jr.: Gagawa na po ng isang kinatawag niyang proclamation na isasama na po yung buong listahan natin.

asr-001274
01:19:02.400 --> 01:19:04.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So parang consolidated proclamation?

asr-001275
01:19:04.600 --> 01:19:05.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-001276
01:19:05.020 --> 01:19:06.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And also, ma'am, the PCUP.

asr-001277
01:19:06.500 --> 01:19:09.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: It's now under, directly, Office of the President.

asr-001278
01:19:10.040 --> 01:19:11.220
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Yes, under the Office of the President.

asr-001279
01:19:11.220 --> 01:19:13.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So one of the reasons po ito, kaya ginawang ganoon, is to...

asr-001280
01:19:13.780 --> 01:19:16.180
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And you do believe that it will really facilitate things?

asr-001281
01:19:16.600 --> 01:19:17.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yes, yes.

asr-001282
01:19:17.660 --> 01:19:19.320
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And of course, you have to follow it up?

asr-001283
01:19:19.740 --> 01:19:20.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yes, ma'am. We'll do that.

asr-001284
01:19:20.940 --> 01:19:21.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Okay.

asr-001285
01:19:21.740 --> 01:19:23.680
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Tama ho ba yan? Wala na po akong oras.

asr-001286
01:19:26.360 --> 01:19:29.600
Committee Secretary: One minute and 30 seconds. 30 seconds po.

asr-001286-split-1
01:19:30.593 --> 01:19:34.520
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: 30 seconds. One minute and 30 seconds.

asr-001287
01:19:34.660 --> 01:19:35.320
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Thank you very much.

asr-001289
01:19:35.700 --> 01:19:40.460
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Lagi rin pong problema ng mga komunidad ang pagdagsa ng mga private complainants.

asr-001290
01:19:40.460 --> 01:19:48.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I'm sorry, private claimants na sa mga lupaing pinuklamaw na para sa kanilang dekade-dekade na ang nakalipas.

asr-001291
01:19:48.900 --> 01:19:55.820
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The delays in the distribution of titles and selas have allowed for these private claimants to emerge

asr-001292
01:19:55.820 --> 01:20:00.220
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and take advantage of the informal settler families.

asr-001293
01:20:00.900 --> 01:20:06.140
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ang nangyayari tuloy, lagi nilang kinakaharap ang mga banta ng ebiksyon at demolisyon.

asr-001294
01:20:06.140 --> 01:20:07.800
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Now, ang tanong ko po is,

asr-001295
01:20:07.960 --> 01:20:16.300
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: does DSUD or any of its key agencies provide legal assistance so the informal settler families have to fight for the land

asr-001296
01:20:16.300 --> 01:20:22.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: that was already proclaimed for them decades ago in court and respond to other legal issues?

asr-001297
01:20:22.820 --> 01:20:27.580
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Lalo na yan, yung mga private claimants, bigla nalang mga sumusulpot po yan.

asr-001298
01:20:28.000 --> 01:20:35.900
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And the affected informal settler families become helpless in the face of these private claims.

asr-001299
01:20:38.120 --> 01:20:39.520
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Is there any mechanism?

asr-001299-split-1
01:20:40.180 --> 01:20:43.960
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: Currently po, there's no mechanism under the DSUD for the private complainants.

asr-001300
01:20:43.960 --> 01:20:51.180
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: Ang meron po ang DSUD are for those who complain against professional squatters and squatting syndicates

asr-001301
01:20:51.180 --> 01:20:53.680
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: at saka po yung mga anti-illegal real estate practices.

asr-001302
01:20:53.680 --> 01:20:59.120
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: But for the claimants of the land, ng mga privado po na complainants, wala po tayong mekanismo para doon.

asr-001303
01:20:59.120 --> 01:21:02.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Wala pa. And these are cases pending in court.

asr-001304
01:21:04.020 --> 01:21:04.540
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Yes?

asr-001305
01:21:04.540 --> 01:21:05.520
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: Yes.

asr-001306
01:21:05.520 --> 01:21:07.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And therefore, it's actually difficult for you.

asr-001307
01:21:07.920 --> 01:21:09.780
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: To come up with that mechanism.

asr-001308
01:21:10.000 --> 01:21:14.240
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: But mas madali siyempre yung going after the syndicates.

asr-001309
01:21:14.797 --> 01:21:14.999
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: Yes.

asr-001310
01:21:14.999 --> 01:21:17.360
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Of mga fake titles.

asr-001311
01:21:17.840 --> 01:21:19.520
DHSUD Undersecretary Marisol D.L. Anenias: Opo, kasi executive po sa police power po.

asr-001312
01:21:19.940 --> 01:21:20.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Okay.

asr-001313
01:21:20.740 --> 01:21:25.620
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Doon po sa expanded pambansang pabahay para sa Pilipino program or the 4PH.

asr-001314
01:21:25.980 --> 01:21:33.860
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Now the CMP, the Community Mortgage Program, which allows informal settler families to collectively own land,

asr-001315
01:21:34.540 --> 01:21:37.740
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: has approved 36 projects covering 6,000.

asr-001316
01:21:37.740 --> 01:21:39.660
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Potential beneficiaries.

asr-001317
01:21:40.000 --> 01:21:42.660
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I'll just finish this line of questioning, Madam Chair.

asr-001319
01:21:43.000 --> 01:21:47.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: How many of these projects are located in coastal areas for fisher folk communities?

asr-001320
01:21:49.880 --> 01:21:52.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: SHFC President will reply.

asr-001321
01:21:52.200 --> 01:21:58.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Yan po yung sektor na medyo nakukulangan yung sa serbisyo.

asr-001322
01:21:59.460 --> 01:22:02.020
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Madam Chair, I will answer.

asr-001323
01:22:03.400 --> 01:22:06.720
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Let us check our data.

asr-001324
01:22:07.080 --> 01:22:17.060
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Madam Chair, so that we will identify those areas which were already approved along the shores.

asr-001325
01:22:17.520 --> 01:22:18.660
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: So the coastal.

asr-001326
01:22:18.800 --> 01:22:22.020
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Right now, we have already approved 47, Madam.

asr-001327
01:22:22.020 --> 01:22:26.700
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: And we have benefited almost 9,000 families.

asr-001328
01:22:27.100 --> 01:22:29.700
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: But we will check based on our records.

asr-001329
01:22:29.860 --> 01:22:31.500
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: And certainly there would be others.

asr-001330
01:22:32.020 --> 01:22:32.440
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: There will be

asr-001331
01:22:32.440 --> 01:22:33.720
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Other coastal communities.

asr-001332
01:22:33.740 --> 01:22:37.780
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: In fact, in our pipeline, there are already 60 applications.

asr-001333
01:22:37.780 --> 01:22:39.800
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: That are pending with us.

asr-001334
01:22:39.940 --> 01:22:42.380
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Subject to availability of funds.

asr-001335
01:22:42.840 --> 01:22:43.320
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Okay.

asr-001336
01:22:43.360 --> 01:22:44.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: My time is up.

asr-001337
01:22:44.320 --> 01:22:45.320
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So thank you very much.

asr-001338
01:22:45.620 --> 01:22:46.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much.

asr-001339
01:22:46.980 --> 01:22:50.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Next to interpellate, Representative Lani Mercado-Revilla.

asr-001340
01:22:54.480 --> 01:22:56.840
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Magandang hapon po sa ating pong housing department.

asr-001341
01:22:58.380 --> 01:23:01.100
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Just a quick question, Madam Chair.

asr-001342
01:23:02.080 --> 01:23:03.020
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: My time is up.

asr-001343
01:23:04.260 --> 01:23:05.320
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Bilis naman nun.

asr-001344
01:23:06.540 --> 01:23:09.860
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Anyway, my question is with the

asr-001345
01:23:09.860 --> 01:23:10.420
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: NHA.

asr-001346
01:23:11.000 --> 01:23:20.780
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: I have noticed that in the NEP, you have a budget of 370 million pesos for locally funded projects.

asr-001347
01:23:21.160 --> 01:23:27.760
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Resettlement program for ISFs affected by the Supreme Court, Mandamos, to clean up the Manila Bay.

asr-001348
01:23:28.600 --> 01:23:31.020
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Would this be budget enough?

asr-001349
01:23:31.020 --> 01:23:37.520
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: I would like to ask how much a building would cost with 60 units?

asr-001350
01:23:38.340 --> 01:23:40.640
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Kasi alam ko ang 370 million.

asr-001351
01:23:41.720 --> 01:23:44.040
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Would be short for two buildings.

asr-001352
01:23:44.580 --> 01:23:46.560
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Am I correct, Madam Chair?

asr-001353
01:23:48.840 --> 01:23:53.120
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Madam Chair, a building would cost around 70 to 90 million pesos.

asr-001354
01:23:53.720 --> 01:23:59.040
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: So this, I think, would be able to construct maybe around four buildings.

asr-001355
01:23:59.420 --> 01:24:00.440
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Four buildings.

asr-001356
01:24:02.000 --> 01:24:04.680
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: I would speak first for my district.

asr-001357
01:24:04.680 --> 01:24:10.900
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: There is a backlog of 2,000 plus units in our district.

asr-001358
01:24:11.720 --> 01:24:18.960
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: I can't imagine how could NHA be able to answer to help our informal settler families

asr-001359
01:24:19.260 --> 01:24:22.440
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: who's affected by the Supreme Court, Mandamos, to clean up Manila Bay

asr-001360
01:24:22.440 --> 01:24:32.360
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: if NHA has only 370 million pesos at a budget of 70 million per building with 60 units.

asr-001361
01:24:32.940 --> 01:24:35.960
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: So, Madam Chair, I think we should also consider

asr-001362
01:24:37.300 --> 01:24:41.120
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: how many buildings can be constructed by NHA.

asr-001363
01:24:41.120 --> 01:24:42.780
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: In a year's time.

asr-001364
01:24:42.780 --> 01:24:49.440
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: And also, kamusta po yung pagta-transfer po natin ng mga informal settler families

asr-001365
01:24:49.440 --> 01:24:52.780
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: in existing National Housing Authority projects?

asr-001366
01:24:56.040 --> 01:24:57.960
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Tuloy-tuloy naman po ang pagta-transfer.

asr-001367
01:24:57.960 --> 01:24:59.920
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: But as of the moment, wala po amin na-transfer

asr-001368
01:24:59.920 --> 01:25:03.560
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: because mas kakaunti po yung napoproduce natin

asr-001369
01:25:03.560 --> 01:25:07.180
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: compared po sa dami ng kailangan pong i-transfer.

asr-001370
01:25:07.340 --> 01:25:08.460
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: And to add to all that,

asr-001371
01:25:08.660 --> 01:25:10.260
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: medyo na,

asr-001372
01:25:11.780 --> 01:25:12.860
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: medyo nahirapan

asr-001373
01:25:12.860 --> 01:25:13.660
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: lang kami sa projection

asr-001374
01:25:13.660 --> 01:25:15.300
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: because our projects are multi-year

asr-001375
01:25:15.300 --> 01:25:17.800
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: and based on the 3 gaas,

asr-001376
01:25:18.380 --> 01:25:19.980
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: we're getting more than 3 billion

asr-001377
01:25:19.980 --> 01:25:23.040
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: but naslash po yung NEP namin for this year.

asr-001378
01:25:23.040 --> 01:25:28.560
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: So, if hindi po ma-restore yan to previous levels as last year,

asr-001379
01:25:30.680 --> 01:25:32.340
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: matutuloy po namin yung mga ongoing

asr-001380
01:25:32.340 --> 01:25:36.140
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: but we're not able to accommodate po yung mga new projects

asr-001381
01:25:36.140 --> 01:25:37.740
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and to fund those new projects.

asr-001382
01:25:38.480 --> 01:25:42.540
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: So, Madam Chair, I think there's a difficulty for NHA to,

asr-001383
01:25:42.540 --> 01:25:45.220
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: to support the program of the President

asr-001384
01:25:45.220 --> 01:25:47.380
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: when it comes to informal settler families,

asr-001385
01:25:47.680 --> 01:25:49.840
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: especially to comply with the Manila Bay Mandamo.

asr-001386
01:25:49.920 --> 01:25:52.800
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: So, I think we should support NHA on this.

asr-001387
01:25:53.640 --> 01:25:57.640
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Balik po tayo dun sa tanong kanina tungkol po sa EHAP.

asr-001388
01:25:59.000 --> 01:26:02.880
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Nasabi po nila na wala ng pondo para sa EHAP.

asr-001389
01:26:03.480 --> 01:26:06.840
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Marami pa hong mga local government units ang umaasa

asr-001390
01:26:07.520 --> 01:26:09.980
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: sa pondong ito, like in my district, for example,

asr-001391
01:26:10.240 --> 01:26:11.620
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: napangakuan po ang,

asr-001392
01:26:12.620 --> 01:26:15.100
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: ilan sa mga pamilya doon

asr-001393
01:26:15.500 --> 01:26:20.080
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and you still have a shortage of around 117 families

asr-001394
01:26:20.720 --> 01:26:22.680
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: who are, should be given 30,000 pesos

asr-001395
01:26:22.680 --> 01:26:24.520
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: pero wala na po ang pondo.

asr-001396
01:26:24.520 --> 01:26:29.640
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: So, how would NHA be able to comply with this shortage

asr-001397
01:26:31.060 --> 01:26:32.300
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and how can DBM assist them?

asr-001398
01:26:32.420 --> 01:26:35.400
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: At marami pa hong mga buwan na natitira sa taong ito

asr-001399
01:26:35.780 --> 01:26:39.080
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: para sa tulong na ito na kailangan ng ating mga mamamayan.

asr-001400
01:26:39.700 --> 01:26:42.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Regarding the funds for,

asr-001401
01:26:42.640 --> 01:26:43.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: EHAP or IDSAB?

asr-001402
01:26:43.775 --> 01:26:44.500
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: EHAP.

asr-001403
01:26:44.500 --> 01:26:50.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We were informed verbally by the Office of the President

asr-001404
01:26:50.140 --> 01:26:51.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: that within the next two weeks,

asr-001405
01:26:51.620 --> 01:26:53.680
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we will be able to,

asr-001406
01:26:53.680 --> 01:26:56.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: they will be able to release the funds for this.

asr-001407
01:26:56.400 --> 01:26:58.440
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Looking forward to that, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001408
01:26:58.560 --> 01:27:00.100
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: That is good news for us.

asr-001409
01:27:00.180 --> 01:27:00.420
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Thank you.

asr-001410
01:27:00.920 --> 01:27:02.420
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: And also, there are

asr-001411
01:27:02.420 --> 01:27:06.980
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: existing SHAPSI projects in my district

asr-001412
01:27:07.180 --> 01:27:11.020
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and I'm sure there are a lot in the different locations in the country.

asr-001413
01:27:11.020 --> 01:27:11.332
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Okay.

asr-001414
01:27:12.120 --> 01:27:14.300
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: I hope SHAPSI would also consider

asr-001415
01:27:14.300 --> 01:27:17.400
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: continuing SHAPSI projects

asr-001416
01:27:17.400 --> 01:27:20.160
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: who don't have parking lots.

asr-001417
01:27:21.220 --> 01:27:24.800
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: I speak specifically of Ciudad de Strike in our district.

asr-001418
01:27:25.080 --> 01:27:25.520
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: There are,

asr-001419
01:27:25.620 --> 01:27:28.940
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: nalipatan na po ito ng mga kababayan natin

asr-001420
01:27:28.940 --> 01:27:33.240
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: from Las Piñas, Paranaque, Bacoor, and other areas.

asr-001421
01:27:33.720 --> 01:27:37.780
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: But unfortunately, the community is in need of a parking lot building.

asr-001422
01:27:38.060 --> 01:27:41.060
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: A lot has been given to the Homeowners Association

asr-001423
01:27:41.500 --> 01:27:42.020
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: but unfortunately,

asr-001424
01:27:42.920 --> 01:27:44.980
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: they cannot fund a parking lot building

asr-001425
01:27:44.980 --> 01:27:48.500
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: because it would cost around 60 to 80 million pesos.

asr-001426
01:27:48.680 --> 01:27:52.460
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: How can SHAPSI assist such kind of problems

asr-001427
01:27:52.460 --> 01:27:53.460
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: in different communities?

asr-001428
01:27:54.329 --> 01:27:54.667
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Yes.

asr-001429
01:27:55.072 --> 01:27:55.713
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Madam Chair,

asr-001430
01:27:58.060 --> 01:28:01.300
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: the Ciudad de Strike was built or constructed

asr-001431
01:28:01.300 --> 01:28:04.520
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: prior to 2022.

asr-001432
01:28:05.660 --> 01:28:09.600
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: But we can revisit the plans of Ciudad de Strike

asr-001433
01:28:09.600 --> 01:28:11.460
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: and we'll see and study

asr-001434
01:28:11.460 --> 01:28:12.780
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: how we can

asr-001435
01:28:12.780 --> 01:28:14.020
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: accommodate that request

asr-001436
01:28:14.020 --> 01:28:16.040
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: from the good congressman.

asr-001437
01:28:16.160 --> 01:28:16.740
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Yes.

asr-001438
01:28:16.840 --> 01:28:18.700
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: It is a difficulty for the community

asr-001439
01:28:18.700 --> 01:28:21.560
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: to make use and utilize the roads,

asr-001440
01:28:21.560 --> 01:28:22.940
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: especially if there are emergencies.

asr-001441
01:28:23.860 --> 01:28:25.980
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Kung may sunog sa mga gusali

asr-001442
01:28:25.980 --> 01:28:29.380
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: where they have around 60 units per building

asr-001443
01:28:29.380 --> 01:28:33.700
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and I think they have more than 40 buildings

asr-001444
01:28:33.700 --> 01:28:36.120
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: already constructed phase 1 and phase 2.

asr-001445
01:28:36.260 --> 01:28:38.100
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: So it is very detrimental

asr-001446
01:28:38.100 --> 01:28:41.560
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: that a parking lot building be allocated.

asr-001447
01:28:41.780 --> 01:28:42.280
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: And I hope,

asr-001448
01:28:42.280 --> 01:28:42.940
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: SHAPSI,

asr-001449
01:28:42.940 --> 01:28:44.060
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: should also consider

asr-001450
01:28:44.060 --> 01:28:45.620
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: such developments

asr-001451
01:28:45.620 --> 01:28:47.520
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: in your future projects,

asr-001452
01:28:47.820 --> 01:28:50.800
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: be it township development, for that matter.

asr-001453
01:28:50.900 --> 01:28:51.720
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Madam Chair,

asr-001454
01:28:51.860 --> 01:28:54.320
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: and as far as the projects

asr-001455
01:28:54.320 --> 01:28:56.040
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: that were newly constructed,

asr-001456
01:28:56.360 --> 01:28:58.400
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: we have adequate open space

asr-001457
01:28:58.400 --> 01:28:59.620
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: for these projects.

asr-001458
01:29:01.140 --> 01:29:02.920
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Thank you very much, Madam Chair.

asr-001459
01:29:03.020 --> 01:29:04.100
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: That would be all.

asr-001460
01:29:04.100 --> 01:29:04.800
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: And I hope,

asr-001461
01:29:04.800 --> 01:29:06.300
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and I second the motion

asr-001462
01:29:06.300 --> 01:29:09.880
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: of our good chairperson of housing,

asr-001463
01:29:10.280 --> 01:29:11.660
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: Congresswoman Copilar,

asr-001464
01:29:11.660 --> 01:29:12.800
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: in adding,

asr-001465
01:29:12.800 --> 01:29:14.300
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: more funding

asr-001466
01:29:14.300 --> 01:29:16.100
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: for the Department of Housing

asr-001467
01:29:16.100 --> 01:29:18.800
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: to support the housing programs

asr-001468
01:29:18.800 --> 01:29:20.640
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: of the Bagong Pilipinas

asr-001469
01:29:20.640 --> 01:29:21.440
Rep. Lani Mercado-Revilla: and our President. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001470
01:29:21.600 --> 01:29:24.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you, Representative Mercado.

asr-001471
01:29:24.860 --> 01:29:27.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We will just act on your motion

asr-001472
01:29:27.640 --> 01:29:28.560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: on the proper time.

asr-001473
01:29:30.440 --> 01:29:31.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Next to the pilot,

asr-001474
01:29:32.160 --> 01:29:34.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: DML, Sergio Dagooc.

asr-001475
01:29:39.640 --> 01:29:41.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001476
01:29:42.120 --> 01:29:43.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magandang hapon po sa ating lahat.

asr-001477
01:29:44.380 --> 01:29:45.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Lalong-lalo na siya,

asr-001478
01:29:45.360 --> 01:29:46.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa ating bisita

asr-001479
01:29:47.600 --> 01:29:48.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: housing

asr-001480
01:29:51.560 --> 01:29:52.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: housing family

asr-001481
01:29:52.760 --> 01:29:53.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ipaluap ko lang yung

asr-001482
01:29:53.860 --> 01:29:55.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: tanong ko

asr-001483
01:29:55.580 --> 01:30:13.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tanong ko, two years ago, paano natin ma-implement mula sa puso yung mga programa natin sa housing kung mismo mga empleyado ninyo walang bahay?

asr-001484
01:30:13.620 --> 01:30:32.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I have requested, no, an inventory sa lahat ng mga agencies natin involved in housing, no, the SOAD, yung National Home Mortgage Finance Corporation, NHA, hindi nga kayo nag-submit eh.

asr-001485
01:30:34.040 --> 01:30:41.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For example, sa Department of Human Settlements and All.

asr-001486
01:30:41.720 --> 01:30:55.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For example, sa Department of Urban Development, out of 100 respondents na pinano ninyo, 36.1% lang yung may bahay.

asr-001487
01:30:55.100 --> 01:30:58.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pakitsik sa record ninyo, ito yung natanggap ko.

asr-001488
01:30:58.440 --> 01:31:12.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon sa social housing, sa finance corporation, out of 197 from 222 plantilia, 49% lang.

asr-001489
01:31:12.920 --> 01:31:16.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang may sariling housing.

asr-001490
01:31:17.840 --> 01:31:19.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 30% are renting.

asr-001491
01:31:19.740 --> 01:31:23.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: And here is, no, the harshest irony.

asr-001492
01:31:24.760 --> 01:31:31.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 21% are occupying housing structures with or without the consent of the owner.

asr-001493
01:31:32.680 --> 01:31:40.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Imagine, hirap na kung matitirhan yung mga empleyado ninyo, pagdating sa opisina, magpapra-process sila ng mga housing projects.

asr-001494
01:31:40.880 --> 01:31:42.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Anong nasa loob nila?

asr-001495
01:31:42.240 --> 01:31:48.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, hindi ko nalang babasahin lahat kasi baka magulat lahat doon sa report.

asr-001496
01:31:48.420 --> 01:31:54.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Basta, bottom line, marami kayong empleyado na wala pang sariling bahay.

asr-001497
01:31:54.820 --> 01:31:56.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Paano nyo i-implement, no?

asr-001498
01:31:56.920 --> 01:32:05.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung inyong bandato, kung yung nag-implement mismo, walang matitirhang bahay.

asr-001499
01:32:05.900 --> 01:32:20.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ano bang solusyon? For the last three years, again, paulit-ulit ko ito tinanong.

asr-001500
01:32:20.880 --> 01:32:23.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi lang po sa...

asr-001501
01:32:23.300 --> 01:32:23.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Madam Chair, may I...

asr-001502
01:32:23.780 --> 01:32:24.800
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po ay nangyayari sa, hindi lang sa DSUD, sa iba pang mga ahensya.

asr-001503
01:32:24.800 --> 01:32:31.760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: But particularly po sa ating resulta ng survey, tama po yung mga numero na banggit po ninyo.

asr-001504
01:32:31.780 --> 01:32:37.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, lahat po naman sila ay ini-encourage natin na mag-avail nitong 4PH.

asr-001505
01:32:37.520 --> 01:32:45.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: In fact, pagdating nila sa application sa pag-ibig, meron po tayong priority dyan.

asr-001506
01:32:45.320 --> 01:32:58.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Hindi lang po sa DSUD employees, basta po government employee and OFW, meron pong priority sa 4PH, pag-apply po sa pag-ibig fund.

asr-001507
01:32:58.260 --> 01:33:06.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon, hindi po natin kasi rin mapilit yung mga kasama natin na hindi sila nag-avail ng mga pabahay.

asr-001508
01:33:06.660 --> 01:33:12.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, they are encouraged but we have no control over them on their decision to purchase their homes.

asr-001509
01:33:15.880 --> 01:33:16.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Madam Chair...

asr-001510
01:33:17.260 --> 01:33:26.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Madam Chair, does the answer means that the problem is with the employees? They don't want to avail?

asr-001511
01:33:29.240 --> 01:33:41.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang ano po kasi ito, ang reality, hindi lang po ito sa government employees, pati po sa private sector, hindi po lahat ngayon willing or gustong mag-pumili po ng bahay.

asr-001512
01:33:41.360 --> 01:33:47.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yan po ang reality. Kahit mag-survey po tayo sa labas, parang kotse po ito, hindi po lahat willing mag-bili ng kotse.

asr-001513
01:33:47.600 --> 01:33:48.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yung iba po, mas gusto natin.

asr-001514
01:33:48.520 --> 01:33:58.560
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, in this case, mag-renta po sa mga bahay. So, yun po yung reality talaga in general, not only among government employees po.

asr-001515
01:34:00.160 --> 01:34:19.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, in short, wala na tayong magagawa dito. We are employing people who are processing applications for housing but they themselves do not want to avail housing.

asr-001516
01:34:19.860 --> 01:34:29.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magkasalubong yun eh. Ako, nagtatrabaho ako sa kuryente. Pero ayaw kong magpakabit ng kuryente. Ganon ang sinasabi nyo eh. Ganon ang kalalabasan.

asr-001517
01:34:29.440 --> 01:34:42.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yun po ang, Madam Chair, yun po ang reality na nakikita natin. Hindi po lahat, although as I said, they are encouraged to avail of this program, but we have no control over their decision, Madam Chair.

asr-001518
01:34:42.460 --> 01:34:46.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ganito na lang, Madam Chair, kasi...

asr-001519
01:34:46.140 --> 01:35:02.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: This representation with all juristics, ay hindi po 100%. I have reservation doon sa sagot.

asr-001520
01:35:05.100 --> 01:35:16.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: May I just request, Madam Chair, for this budget briefing. May I request that these agencies will submit...

asr-001521
01:35:16.460 --> 01:35:18.360
