asr-002998
03:00:56.560 --> 03:01:00.820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Unang-una po, ang priority po natin na gagamit ng ating mga rental housing,

asr-002999
03:01:00.920 --> 03:01:03.540
