asr-003000
03:01:04.040 --> 03:01:10.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, sa kasulukuyan po, meron tayong around 5,000 units na sinimula na ng mga housing rental.

asr-003001
03:01:12.580 --> 03:01:16.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Makukuha po yan sa DSUD, yung data na yan, kung nasaan yung mga locations.

asr-003002
03:01:16.680 --> 03:01:29.160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then second, meron din po tayong off-site CMP na buo po yung community na nilipat sila sa ibang site.

asr-003003
03:01:29.280 --> 03:01:31.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Applicable din po yung programa na yun.

asr-003004
03:01:31.340 --> 03:01:33.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yun naman po is under the SHFC.

asr-003005
03:01:34.840 --> 03:01:39.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So sa ngayon, Madam Chair, halimbawa, yung nabanggit ko po sa tagig,

asr-003006
