DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Madam Chair, kung pwede po, makikipag-coordinate na lang kami directly doon sa community

asr-003010
03:02:00.680 --> 03:02:05.760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: para makita natin anong government program ang applicable o mas appropriate po sa kanila.

asr-003011
