Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi lahat po ng mga nilalaban nating agencies, number one na po yung DepEd,

asr-003025
03:03:28.940 --> 03:03:35.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na dapat may highest allocation, may highest priority pagdating sa budget allocation.

asr-003026
