asr-003075
03:07:57.180 --> 03:07:59.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, I look forward to work with you.

asr-003076
03:07:59.400 --> 03:08:02.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And the remaining years, no? Of the President

