03:08:02.780 --> 03:08:10.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: PBBM, I know we can achieve the 22,000 additional pabahay from your end.

asr-003078
03:08:10.600 --> 03:08:21.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: At the same time, hindi man natin mabot yung 3.6 million na housing backlog, but at least the 1.3 million, kakayanin natin lahat yan.

asr-003079
03:08:21.560 --> 03:08:29.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: With Chair Mica around, she will also help us to make sure that we can also generate more funds.

