asr-003130
03:43:07.280 --> 03:43:16.140
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And actually, there was a time that we actually helped the formation of this fund.

asr-003131
03:43:16.360 --> 03:43:20.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: With that being said, Madam Chair, and Chair, please,

asr-003132
03:43:20.420 --> 03:43:27.940
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I urge to increase its budget as much as possible.

asr-003133
03:43:27.940 --> 03:43:30.280
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Kung kaya talaga, Madam Chair.

asr-003134
03:43:31.260 --> 03:43:32.820
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yun lang, Madam Chair.

asr-003135
03:43:33.240 --> 03:43:34.260
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, thank you.

asr-003136
03:43:35.940 --> 03:43:39.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you very much, DS Mendoza, for your support.

